      "finding_2": "The predominant fraud pattern in PaySim is a static single-step balance drain (attacker creates a TRANSFER or CASH_OUT transaction where oldbalanceOrg == amount). Point-in-time causal baseline features (diff_orig_bal_amt = oldbalanceOrg - amount, oldbalanceOrg, amount, type) fully capture this structural signature without needing historical context.",
